                  "id": 3111035,
                  "name": "以智取胜",
                  "order": 1
                },
                {
                  "description": "我方全体造成的物理属性伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>50%</unbreak></color>，效果抵抗提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>50%</unbreak></color>。",
                  "id": 3111036,
                  "name": "拔山举鼎",
                  "order": 2
                },
                {
                  "description": "我方单位击破敌方目标弱点时，行动提前<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>20%</unbreak></color>。",
